u                                       //undo last operation
yy                                      //copy a line, y=yank, yank means copy
p                                       //paste a line
dd                                      //delete the entire line in normal mode
x                                       //delete one character in normal mode
:w                                      //save changes to a file
:q                                      //quit without saving
:wq                                     //save and quit
:q!                                     //force quit without saving 
:o<file>                                //open specified file
/<word>                                 //search for the word, n browse from top to bottom, N from bottom to top
i                                       //edit mode
v                                       //visual mode: can select some contents with mouse and delete with D key
ctrl+v                                  //visual block mode
$ vimtutor                              //get help



